<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris declares 22 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris declares 22 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd announced on Wednesday a first and final dividend of 22 percent for the 1996/97 (April-March) financial year.</p>
<p>It declared a dividend of 20 percent in the pevious financial year.</p>
</text>
